      "lqs": [
        {
                "q": "Write a short paragraph summarizing what you learned from Chapter 13.",
                "ans": "Every person in a society chooses a job to earn an honest livelihood and serve the community. These jobs are called professions.\n\nCommon professions:\n\u2022 Teacher: educates students and builds good character.\n\u2022 Doctor and Nurse: examine patients, treat diseases, and save lives.\n\u2022 Police Officer: maintains law and order and protects citizens from criminals.\n\u2022 Firefighter: rescues people from fires and disasters.\n\u2022 Engineer: designs roads, bridges, and machines.\n\u2022 Carpenter: makes furniture and wooden items.\n\u2022 Cobbler and Tailor: repair shoes and stitch clothes.\n\nEvery profession deserves dignity and respect."
        }
]
